livered_customer_date` (2.965). Estes missings estão nos pedidos não entregues e desaparecem quando filtramos apenas `delivered`.\n","\n","`order_status` está muito concentrado em `delivered` (97%). Os restantes estados somam apenas 3% e não entram no modelo.\n","\n","`customer_id` é único por linha, ou seja, não identifica clientes repetidos. Para agrupar pedidos do mesmo cliente é necessário o `customer_unique_id` da tabela de customers.\n","\n"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":2,"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/","height":1000,"referenced_widgets":["3a55c033d4ec433f92e04faa5a4a83bf","22e63e25041d476b8e93e43ac962defc","a5c99d6c83e942ab8928417e91bd9ed8","18c66642dc99401f90a1361db7891300","669038d6e0444251bb6d9b4867b94ec8","40e6a461a53040e8aa8003baa6a60fa4","69b5ed13245f481e8e46470ace4fa783","3fa9b43b934b40f1a857a8cb8589c83d","32f18030ab094ee081ecf4a4427faf89","c9d3836240fb49798a22c1b1fa9df737","2d489df07e764a2d9ee7ace8f4abe763","df52300edc5e4f3ea09a774e6a900f46","985d5aadc7f34c81b975b4625e08da9d","214ba06689c34e85b3751a1b73430587","8bc132a962b242448c36bf3aa0806768","3975df9e783043dab1566256ea061abd","4a9646c8aa3942d895b70fbf93b3995d","3c69696917d74d4089be0e438e334ad1","6e7d2d477bb047d5af71b350e5afb819","d570081403fe46828f119b53631fc353","ce40f6ac00fe4c16a928224963ca3347","91d9a0aefb574686a528873b509444fa","902f20f981bd46f48bf01f18045456ac","c44f5ee06f654718bee419c08625b755","dd3c7952bdf94ab3a0ebbc27f406ddac","5544489724944565bf95fb6f54bac135","b61ab3fb2003444cab35c8343cfd0702","ca303d02dd3542d8be6cdc55af041134","cbc2dea497b2488f9a2569174891af0b","8d6075111de947cba485b107844c99ca","7e4b2265c46e4b5983ac5176b9e1f527","eff209e93fea477d9d4e610ca45d75bb","8ef774daed274e10afc577eadc3ca20e","0359aab84c4e4e60ae249b6d4b15d8de","259fbc6cf4b04581b2a23fdae12d0660","c6a009cabb044c7fa0f0ac9b01846549","c5faa26a7454448d97429e95b98aa101","f2bc42ce879a4862be11a4944e6eed85","ac4a6b5265c84b04a705dd3bb0fd08da","1b4c5d0b46994b2b8085f14c01acbe15","aabf55277ec